Package: bayesmetaipd
Title: Bayesian Random-Effects Meta-Analysis for IPD and AD (Logistic)
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Yuan", "Zhou", email = "yuanzhouu@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits Bayesian hierarchical random-effects meta-analysis models
    using individual participant data (IPD) and aggregate data (AD) with a
    logistic observation model. Default settings reproduce Simulation Study 2
    Benchmark and IPD+AD results from Kim et al. (Bayesian-Meta supplementary
    materials).
